<figure id="S5.T5" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>. </span><span id="S5.T5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Pass@k (%) before and after training, grouped by base model. We report pass@k with <math id="S5.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\text{ (number of samples)}=20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> (number of samples)</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\text{ (number of samples)}=20</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
